Optional deferred PIO completion through the existing port

Memory BAR transactions need timing backpressure and asynchronous completion.
Provide opt-in hooks while retaining native range notifications and default
SimpleTimingPort behavior. Validated by BAR2, FLR and HDI COPY regressions.

